It does have an internal diary! Just #name your key or luckstone with 
your notes.

I can't think of any major events it would be able to record. It already 
records what you've identified (view with \), and I think it'd be too 
useful if it automatically did things like recording what turn you 
learned spells on. The only possible thing would be basically an 
automatic logger, which keeps track of every message you've gotten and 
the turn you got it on. I feel it's my responsibility to notice those 
though. I personally like the fact that I have to take notes myself 
(usually just #naming an object with stash locations).

